Description: ExpoMet is a lightweight R package that provides a standardized, end-to-end analytical workflow for exposomics and metabolomics studies. It integrates quality control, preprocessing, feature filtering, data transformation, association analyses, visualization, and reproducible reporting into a single, cohesive analytical pipeline. Built with minimal software dependencies and intuitive data frame-based workflows, ExpoMet is designed to be accessible to both trainees and experienced investigators while remaining flexible enough for small experimental studies and large-scale epidemiologic research.
